-landsgemeinde","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"scope":"canton","canton":"GL","language":"es","prompt":"¿Qué asamblea popular se mantiene en el cantón de Glarus?","options":["La Landsgemeinde","El Nationalrat","El Regierungsrat","El Ständerat"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Glarus mantiene la Landsgemeinde como forma de participación política cantonal.","source_url":"https://www.aboutswitzerland.eda.admin.ch/en/political-system","source_title":"DFAE · Participación cantonal","reviewed_at":"2026-11-12","guide_path":"/guias","status":"published","editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["19d3d238b7223986ca8cacc8943f9924"]},{"question":{"id":"game-0-v1","category":"salud","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"Alguien se ha desmayado en la calle y no reacciona. ¿A qué número llamas para pedir una ambulancia?","options":["117","118","144","143"],"correct_index":2,"explanation":"El 144 es el número de ambulancias y urgencias médicas. El 117 es la policía, el 118 los bomberos y el 143 la línea de ayuda emocional. El 112 también funciona desde cualquier móvil.","source_url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/health/health-insurance/","source_title":"ch.ch · Números de emergencia","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true},"known":["402459aa7d90e787ffbcbb7fd09c5fc7"]},{"question":{"id":"game-1-v1","category":"administracion","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"Te mudas de Winterthur a Lucerna. ¿Dónde tienes que registrar tu nuevo domicilio?","options":["En el consulado de tu país","En la oficina de habitantes de tu nuevo municipio","En Correos, al cambiar tu dirección","En ningún sitio si tu permiso sigue vigente"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"Tienes que darte de alta en la oficina de habitantes (Einwohnerkontrolle o contrôle des habitants) del nuevo municipio y de baja en el anterior. El plazo suele ser de 14 días: compruébalo en la web de tu municipio. Cambiar la dirección en Correos solo redirige tus cartas.","source_url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/foreign-nationals-in-switzerland/living-in-switzerland/moving-to-switzerland/","source_title":"ch.ch · Mudanza","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true},"known":["dca6c868c5c81c8fc2af4160c2fa36a1"]},{"question":{"id":"game-2-v1","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"scope":"canton","canton":"ZH","status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"En el cantón de Zürich, ¿qué red reúne trenes, tranvías, autobuses y barcos con billetes por zonas?","options":["ZVV","TPG","Libero","BLT"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El ZVV (Zürcher Verkehrsverbund) organiza el transporte público de todo el cantón con un sistema de zonas. TPG es la empresa de transporte de Ginebra, Libero la comunidad tarifaria de Berna y Soleura, y BLT opera en Basilea-Campiña.","source_url":"https://www.zvv.ch/zvv/en/home.html","source_title":"zvv.ch","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true},"known":["5558f17f461f246dc32d6b38717aa95f"]},{"question":{"id":"game-3-v1","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Te piden una garantía por el alquiler de una vivienda. ¿Cuál es la combinación correcta?","options":["Máximo tres mensualidades y depósito en una cuenta especial a tu nombre","Seis mensualidades y pago definitivo al propietario","Tres mensualidades ingresadas en la cuenta personal del propietario","Cualquier cantidad y cualquier cuenta elegida por el propietario"],"explanation":"La guía federal de vivienda explica el límite de tres mensualidades y la cuenta de garantía a nombre del inquilino. No es un regalo ni un ingreso libremente disponible para el propietario. El supuesto es una vivienda, no un local comercial.","sources":[{"id":"ch-bwo-rent","url":"https://www.bwo.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/HEHpEdcSGcG4/2024-Infoblatt-Spanisch.pdf","title":"BWO · Vivir en Suiza: información sobre el alquiler de viviendas","authority":"Bundesamt für Wohnungswesen","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Los protagonistas; solicitud; contrato; entrega; convivencia"},{"id":"ch-rental","url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/housing/rent/rental-and-leasing-agreements/","title":"ch.ch · Rental and leasing agreements","authority":"Schweizerische Bundeskanzlei","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Concluding; What else; Disputes; Subletting"}],"source_url":"https://www.bwo.admin.ch/dam/de/sd-web/HEHpEdcSGcG4/2024-Infoblatt-Spanisch.pdf","source_title":"BWO · Vivir en Suiza: información sobre el alquiler de viviendas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:deposito-cuenta-vivienda","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","reuses_question_id":"game-3-v1","editorial_id":"szx-ch-deposito-cuenta-vivienda","correct_index":0},"known":["d88f4a1821613b5f143ed0fa775decf6","68f2766c0a44610c9df8270520749e34"]},{"question":{"id":"game-4-v1","category":"administracion","difficulty":1,"scope":"canton","canton":"ZH","status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Cómo se llama el parlamento del cantón de Zürich, que aprueba las leyes cantonales?","options":["Grosser Rat","Kantonsrat","Landrat","Stadtrat"],"correct_index":1,"explanation":"En Zürich el parlamento cantonal es el Kantonsrat, con 180 miembros. Otros cantones usan otros nombres, como Grosser Rat en Berna o Landrat en Basilea-Campiña. El Stadtrat es el gobierno de la ciudad, no del cantón.","source_url":"https://www.zh.ch/de/politik-staat/kantonsrat.html","source_title":"zh.ch · Kantonsrat","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true},"known":["39c9f7cac4fcc18ae568ea6fa39cbbda"]},{"question":{"id":"game-5-v1","category":"trabajo","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"En enero tu empresa te entrega el «Lohnausweis». ¿Qué es?","options":["El certificado anual de salario, para la declaración de impuestos","Tu permiso de trabajo","La nómina de diciembre","Un contrato de trabajo renovado"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El Lohnausweis (certificat de salaire) resume lo que has cobrado durante el año y lo que se ha descontado. Lo necesitas para la declaración de impuestos. La nómina de cada mes se llama Lohnabrechnung.","source_url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/work/taxes/","source_title":"estv.admin.ch · Certificado de salario","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true},"known":["179070afcf9d6a42375b0e37beb69e63"]},{"question":{"id":"game-6-v1","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"ZH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"image","prompt":"¿De qué cantón es este escudo?","options":["Zürich","Luzern","Zug","Bern"],"explanation":"El escudo de Zürich se divide en diagonal en blanco y azul. El escudo de Lucerna se divide verticalmente: no debe confundirse con su bandera horizontal.","sources":[{"id":"zh-wappen-17","url":"https://www.stadt-zuerich.ch/de/stadtleben/stadtportraet/zuerichs-geschichte/stadtarchiv/wissensportal/wappen-stadt-zuerich.html","title":"Stadtarchiv Zürich · Wappen","authority":"Stadt Zürich","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Beschreibung / Blasonierung"},{"id":"lu-wappen-17","url":"https://www.lu.ch/-/media/Kanton/Dokumente/SK/Vortrag/Flagge_Fahne_Wappen_des_Kantons_Luzern.pdf","title":"Staatskanzlei Luzern · Flagge, Fahne, Wappen","authority":"Kanton Luzern","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Primera página: escudo y bandera"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt-zuerich.ch/de/stadtleben/stadtportraet/zuerichs-geschichte/stadtarchiv/wissensportal/wappen-stadt-zuerich.html","source_title":"Stadtarchiv Zürich · Wappen","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"ZH:escudo-reconocer","status":"published","image_key":"zh","image_alt":"Escudo dividido en diagonal, blanco arriba a la derecha y azul abajo a la izquierda","image_rights":"Dibujo SVG propio con finalidad didáctica","editorial_difficulty":"facil","reuses_question_id":"game-6-v1","editorial_id":"szx-zh-escudo-reconocer","game_only":true,"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["565de196d605203479a581c853158abb","a7bf338bc6cd6a3d2cefe1830f7b3160"]},{"question":{"id":"game-7-v1","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"image","prompt":"¿Qué tipo de sendero indica esta marca?","options":["Sendero de montaña (Bergwanderweg)","Sendero alpino marcado blanco-azul-blanco","Sendero de paseo señalizado en amarillo","Una ruta para bicicletas"],"explanation":"Blanco-rojo-blanco identifica los senderos de montaña. La marca no sustituye la preparación, la evaluación del tiempo ni el equipo adecuado.","sources":[{"id":"ch-hiking","url":"https://www.bernerwanderwege.ch/de/rund-ums-wandern/wanderwegkategorien","title":"Wanderwegkategorien","authority":"Berner Wanderwege","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Wanderwege; Bergwanderwege"}],"source_url":"https://www.bernerwanderwege.ch/de/rund-ums-wandern/wanderwegkategorien","source_title":"Wanderwegkategorien","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-13","concept_id":"CH:imagen-sendero-montana","status":"published","image_key":"berg","image_alt":"Roca con tres franjas horizontales: blanca, roja y blanca","image_rights":"Dibujo SVG propio de Suizamente","editorial_difficulty":"facil","reuses_question_id":"game-7-v1","editorial_id":"szx-ch-imagen-sendero-montana","game_only":true,"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["58918021324d15b20e2235a4bf54f4dd","af94dddc7987fbb134a45bc4af127640"]},{"question":{"id":"game-8-v1","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"image","prompt":"¿Dónde se recicla esta botella de bebida vacía?","options":["En un punto de recogida de botellas de bebidas de PET","En el contenedor de vidrio","En la recogida de plásticos mezclados, sin comprobar su admisión","En la basura doméstica para que después se recicle como PET"],"explanation":"Las botellas de bebidas de PET se recogen por separado. El circuito no es un contenedor para todos los objetos o envases de plástico.","sources":[{"id":"ch-pet-2026","url":"https://www.bafu.admin.ch/de/pet-getraenkeflaschen","title":"PET-Getränkeflaschen","authority":"Bundesamt für Umwelt BAFU","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Separatsammlung; PET-Milchflaschen"}],"source_url":"https://www.bafu.admin.ch/de/pet-getraenkeflaschen","source_title":"PET-Getränkeflaschen","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-13","concept_id":"CH:imagen-botella-pet","status":"published","image_key":"pet","image_alt":"Botella de bebida de plástico con una etiqueta PET","image_rights":"Dibujo SVG propio de Suizamente","editorial_difficulty":"facil","reuses_question_id":"game-8-v1","editorial_id":"szx-ch-imagen-botella-pet","game_only":true,"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["c1522bfc4f4278158dc1dfd7d7597f43","af312aa69dad0320681101298f01b161"]},{"question":{"id":"game-9-v1","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Cuál de estas afirmaciones es falsa?","options":["Suiza tiene 26 cantones","Berna es la ciudad federal","Suiza tiene cuatro lenguas nacionales","Suiza es miembro de la Unión Europea"],"correct_index":3,"explanation":"Suiza no es miembro de la Unión Europea: se relaciona con ella mediante acuerdos bilaterales. Las otras tres afirmaciones son ciertas.","source_url":"https://www.eda.admin.ch/aboutswitzerland/en/home/politik/uebersicht.html","source_title":"admin.ch · Suiza y la UE","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"false","game_only":true},"known":["ead064d3cdd2145de37ee7f997e4b342"]},{"question":{"id":"game-10-v1","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"El 1 de agosto es la fiesta nacional de Suiza.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El 1 de agosto se celebra la fundación de la Confederación, con el Pacto Federal de 1291. Es festivo en toda Suiza desde 1994.","source_url":"https://www.eda.admin.ch/aboutswitzerland/en/home/gesellschaft/traditionen/bundesfeier.html","source_title":"admin.ch · Fiesta nacional","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"tf","game_only":true},"known":["d7aedcd2c03e25c4284140a599847da6"]},{"question":{"id":"game-11-v1","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"En la mayoría de municipios, la basura de casa se tira en bolsas oficiales de pago o con una etiqueta.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Casi todos los municipios cobran la basura por bolsa: usas la bolsa oficial (Gebührensack) o pegas la etiqueta de tu municipio. Lo reciclable va aparte y suele ser gratis.","source_url":"https://www.ch.ch/en/foreign-nationals-in-switzerland/living-in-switzerland/moving-to-switzerland/","source_title":"Web de tu municipio","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"tf","game_only":true},"known":["8ad48dc6aa81481a9c8da74404a04375"]},{"question":{"id":"game-12-v1","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"CH","scope":"CH","canton":null,"topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"match","prompt":"Relaciona cada número suizo con su servicio.","options":["117","118","144","145"],"explanation":"BAKOM publica estos números cortos de servicio. No se deben usar llamadas reales para practicar el juego.","sources":[{"id":"ch-emergency","url":"https://www.bakom.admin.ch/en/other-numbers-free-of-charge-or-not","title":"BAKOM · Other numbers: free of charge or not?","authority":"Federal Office of Communications","checked_at":"2026-11-13","locator":"Short numbers; Emergency services"}],"source_url":"https://www.bakom.admin.ch/en/other-numbers-free-of-charge-or-not","source_title":"BAKOM · Other numbers: free of charge or not?","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","verified_at":"2026-11-13","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-13","concept_id":"CH:emergencias-servicio","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","reuses_question_id":"game-12-v1","editorial_id":"szx-ch-emergencias-servicio","game_only":true,"pairs":["Policía","Bomberos","Ambulancia / urgencia médica","Información en caso de intoxicación"],"correct_index":0},"known":["f5987475fdfc63f6e668ed4ab0110e54","e653db5b329892667a225d87c425ecd0"]},{"question":{"id":"game-13-v1","category":"idioma","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"Une cada expresión en suizo alemán con su significado.","options":["Grüezi","Merci vilmal","Uf Wiederluege","Exgüsi"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Son expresiones del día a día en la Suiza de habla alemana. «Grüezi» se usa al saludar a alguien a quien tratas de usted.","source_url":"https://www.eda.admin.ch/aboutswitzerland/en/home/gesellschaft/sprachen.html","source_title":"Latido · Idioma cotidiano","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"match","game_only":true,"pairs":["Hola","Muchas gracias","Adiós","Perdón"]},"known":["045644c23ec49270c8cf63e42cbb1b18"]},{"question":{"id":"game-14-v1","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Cuáles son lenguas nacionales de Suiza?","options":["Alemán","Francés","Inglés","Romanche","Italiano"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Suiza tiene cuatro lenguas nacionales: alemán, francés, italiano y romanche. El inglés se usa mucho, pero no es lengua nacional.","source_url":"https://www.eda.admin.ch/aboutswitzerland/en/home/gesellschaft/sprachen.html","source_title":"admin.ch · Lenguas nacionales","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"multi","game_only":true,"correct_indices":[0,1,3,4]},"known":["3c608e7444c407d6938a39b283bc1c0e"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-1-0","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"El Uetliberg es la montaña de la ciudad de Zürich y tiene una torre mirador en la cima.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El Uetliberg se alza junto a la ciudad de Zürich. Desde la torre mirador de Uto Kulm se ven la ciudad, el lago y, con buen tiempo, los Alpes.","source_url":"https://www.zuerich.com/en/visit/nature/uetliberg-zurichs-very-own-mountain","source_title":"uetliberg.ch","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"tf","game_only":true,"arrival_level":1},"known":["0f102beac7e337fb427331ca35e73b48"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-1-1","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Qué línea ferroviaria conecta normalmente Zürich con el Uetliberg?","options":["Con el tren S10","Con el S5","Con el S7","Con el S12"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"La línea S10 conecta Zürich con la estación Uetliberg. Los horarios, las obras y los tramos en servicio pueden cambiar: consulta ZVV antes de viajar.","source_url":"https://www.zuerich.com/en/visit/nature/uetliberg-zurichs-very-own-mountain","source_title":"zvv.ch · S10","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["89931d848f2a59d7d113a8c4a0e8f0f5"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-1-2","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Qué ruta a pie une el Uetliberg con Felsenegg y muestra el Sol y los planetas a escala?","options":["El camino de los planetas (Planetenweg)","La Vía Alpina","El Camino de Santiago","La ruta del chocolate"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El Planetenweg va del Uetliberg a Felsenegg. A lo largo del camino hay maquetas del Sol y de los planetas, a escala con las distancias reales.","source_url":"https://www.zuerich.com/en/visit/nature/uetliberg-zurichs-very-own-mountain","source_title":"uetliberg.ch · Planetenweg","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":1},"known":["7ec8232b6782990075371d8d41b1c941"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-2-0","category":"sociedad","difficulty":2,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Qué se inauguró en el Rigi en 1871?","options":["El primer tren de montaña de Europa","El primer teleférico del mundo","El primer túnel de los Alpes","La primera pista de esquí"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El tren de cremallera de Vitznau al Rigi abrió en 1871 y fue el primer tren de montaña de Europa. Hoy también se sube desde Arth-Goldau y en teleférico desde Weggis.","source_url":"https://www.rigi.ch/en/about-us/history/history-of-the-first-mountain-railway-of-europe","source_title":"rigi.ch · Historia","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":2},"known":["cca269740b158ea924704fa8d6af1c62"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-2-1","category":"sociedad","difficulty":2,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Junto a qué lago está el Rigi?","options":["El lago de los Cuatro Cantones","El lago Lemán","El lago de Constanza","El lago Maggiore"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El Rigi está entre el lago de los Cuatro Cantones y el lago de Zug. A Vitznau y a Weggis se puede llegar en barco desde Lucerna.","source_url":"https://www.rigi.ch/en/about-us/history/history-of-the-first-mountain-railway-of-europe","source_title":"rigi.ch","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":2},"known":["16cbb7fa4eebd6c9438decc84a9352a1"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-2-2","category":"sociedad","difficulty":2,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"Al Rigi lo llaman «la reina de las montañas».","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Es su apodo desde hace siglos: «Königin der Berge». Su cima, Rigi Kulm, es famosa por las vistas al amanecer.","source_url":"https://www.rigi.ch/en/about-us/history/history-of-the-first-mountain-railway-of-europe","source_title":"rigi.ch","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"tf","game_only":true,"arrival_level":2},"known":["dfe4e01c06847dae25422bb4595e1c4b"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-3-0","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Qué pendiente máxima tiene el tren de cremallera del Pilatus, el más empinado del mundo?","options":["48 %","12 %","25 %","80 %"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El tren de Alpnachstad a Pilatus Kulm llega a una pendiente del 48 %. Es el tren de cremallera más empinado del mundo.","source_url":"https://pilatus.ch/en/railway-cableways/cogwheel-railway","source_title":"pilatus.ch","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":3},"known":["13190ce025eaf0af2eaf9009f0877516"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-3-1","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"Según las leyendas de la zona, ¿qué criaturas vivían en el Pilatus?","options":["Dragones","Unicornios","Gigantes de hielo","Sirenas"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Las leyendas de Lucerna cuentan que en las grietas del Pilatus vivían dragones. Por eso el dragón aparece en tantos recuerdos de la montaña.","source_url":"https://www.pilatus.ch/en/discover/dragon-world","source_title":"pilatus.ch · Leyendas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":3},"known":["80f027700b47650525897163f437fa07"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-3-2","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Qué ciudad está a los pies del Pilatus?","options":["Lucerna","Ginebra","Lugano","Basilea"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El Pilatus se alza junto a Lucerna. Desde la ciudad se sube en góndola y teleférico por Kriens, o en barco y tren de cremallera por Alpnachstad.","source_url":"https://pilatus.ch/en/railway-cableways/cogwheel-railway","source_title":"luzern.com","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":3},"known":["ea2ce68d0f642328975c97c0ccb414aa"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-4-0","category":"sociedad","difficulty":4,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Por qué es famosa la cara norte del Eiger?","options":["Es una de las paredes más difíciles de escalar de los Alpes","Fue la primera pared alpina equipada con un ascensor","Es la ruta más fácil del macizo","Es conocida principalmente por sus viñedos"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"La cara norte del Eiger (Nordwand) mide unos 1800 metros y es una de las grandes paredes de los Alpes. Se escaló por primera vez en 1938.","source_url":"https://www.jungfrau.ch/en-gb/","source_title":"jungfrauregion.swiss","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":4,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["652fc39a019730e3d1e82113bfa415db"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-4-1","category":"sociedad","difficulty":4,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Qué dos montañas forman con el Eiger el trío más famoso del Oberland bernés?","options":["El Mönch y la Jungfrau","El Pilatus y el Rigi","El Säntis y el Titlis","El Matterhorn y el Monte Rosa"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Eiger, Mönch y Jungfrau forman el conocido trío del Oberland bernés. La región de los Alpes suizos Jungfrau-Aletsch está inscrita en la lista de Patrimonio Mundial de la UNESCO.","source_url":"https://www.jungfrau.ch/en-gb/","source_title":"jungfrauregion.swiss","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":4},"known":["841bf7a5959ea25ed8d6743c1e22ca80"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-4-2","category":"sociedad","difficulty":4,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"El tren de la Jungfrau pasa por un túnel dentro del Eiger.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El tren de la Jungfrau sale de Kleine Scheidegg y sube por un túnel excavado dentro del Eiger y del Mönch hasta el Jungfraujoch.","source_url":"https://www.jungfrau.ch/en-gb/","source_title":"jungfrau.ch","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"tf","game_only":true,"arrival_level":4},"known":["830b4a219341ef5368f83a35bdac1f2c"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-5-0","category":"sociedad","difficulty":5,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿Entre qué dos países está el Matterhorn?","options":["Suiza e Italia","Suiza y Francia","Suiza y Austria","Suiza y Alemania"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"El Matterhorn está en la frontera entre Suiza e Italia. En italiano se llama Monte Cervino y en francés, Mont Cervin.","source_url":"https://zermatt.swiss/en/discover-experience/matterhorn","source_title":"zermatt.ch","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":5},"known":["8ae41a472aa85d22a609b9d864fa3471"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-5-1","category":"sociedad","difficulty":5,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"Zermatt es un destino sin libre circulación de coches privados.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Zermatt es un destino sin coches privados. Los visitantes llegan normalmente en tren desde Täsch; existen vehículos eléctricos autorizados y excepciones para servicios.","source_url":"https://zermatt.swiss/en/plan-book/arrival","source_title":"zermatt.ch","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"tf","game_only":true,"arrival_level":5},"known":["8a4bb1f9d6a2438c41eb0d16962c95d6"]},{"question":{"id":"game-arrival-5-2","category":"sociedad","difficulty":5,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"¿En qué año se llegó por primera vez a la cima del Matterhorn?","options":["1865","1765","1915","1965"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"La primera ascensión fue el 14 de julio de 1865, con una cordada encabezada por Edward Whymper.","source_url":"https://zermatt.swiss/en/discover-experience/matterhorn","source_title":"zermatt.ch · Historia","reviewed_at":"2026-11-13","game_type":"choice","game_only":true,"arrival_level":5},"known":["7c45dfd3c3f6dcb0a2e8ac7877a7f4d8"]},{"question":{"id":"game-30-v1","category":"administracion","difficulty":1,"scope":"CH","canton":null,"status":"published","language":"es","prompt":"Acabas de llegar a vivir a Suiza. ¿Dónde te das de alta con tu pasaporte y tu contrato para tramitar tu permiso de residencia?","options":["En la Gemeinde donde vives, en la oficina de habitantes","En la Post","En tu Krankenkasse","En el consulado de tu país"],"correct_index":0,"explanation":"Al llegar te das de alta en la Einwohnerkontrolle de tu Gemeinde, nor