 es el ejecutivo cantonal. Bundesrat designa al Gobierno de la Confederación.","sources":[{"id":"be-government-17","url":"https://www.rr.be.ch/de/start/leichte-sprache/regierung.html","title":"Kanton Bern · Regierungs-Rat","authority":"Kanton Bern","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Regierungs-Rat"}],"source_url":"https://www.rr.be.ch/de/start/leichte-sprache/regierung.html","source_title":"Kanton Bern · Regierungs-Rat","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"BE:gobierno-vs-federal","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["2f2d68ec21aa7267af8faf56f36b4dac"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-be-subsidio-plazo-2026","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"BE","scope":"canton","canton":"BE","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En Berna debes solicitar la Prämienverbilligung de 2026 porque tu derecho no se determina automáticamente. ¿Hasta cuándo debe llegar la solicitud al servicio competente?","options":["31 de diciembre de 2026","31 de marzo de 2027","31 de agosto de 2026","30 de abril de 2026"],"explanation":"El Amt für Sozialversicherungen exige que llegue dentro del año natural al que corresponde la solicitud. No copies el plazo de otro cantón.","sources":[{"id":"be-pv-17","url":"https://www.asv.dij.be.ch/de/start/themen/pv/pv_anrecht-auf-pv-beantragen.html","title":"Amt für Sozialversicherungen · Prämienverbilligung beantragen","authority":"Kanton Bern","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Antrag; pasos 1–5"}],"source_url":"https://www.asv.dij.be.ch/de/start/themen/pv/pv_anrecht-auf-pv-beantragen.html","source_title":"Amt für Sozialversicherungen · Prämienverbilligung beantragen","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2026-12-31","concept_id":"BE:subsidio-plazo-2026","status":"published","validity_year":2026,"editorial_difficulty":"dificil","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["ada0c5fd49059bfc30edccdfc91adfb1"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-be-subsidio-borrador","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"BE","scope":"canton","canton":"BE","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Preparas online la solicitud de ayuda al seguro en Berna y solo pulsas «guardar». ¿Qué te falta?","options":["Finalizar y enviar el expediente con los documentos requeridos","Nada: guardar ya equivale a presentar","Solo cerrar el navegador y esperar respuesta","Solo imprimir el borrador para guardarlo"],"explanation":"Un borrador guardado no se tramita. La página del ASV explica cómo finalizarlo y qué comprobantes pueden ser necesarios.","sources":[{"id":"be-pv-17","url":"https://www.asv.dij.be.ch/de/start/themen/pv/pv_anrecht-auf-pv-beantragen.html","title":"Amt für Sozialversicherungen · Prämienverbilligung beantragen","authority":"Kanton Bern","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Antrag; pasos 1–5"}],"source_url":"https://www.asv.dij.be.ch/de/start/themen/pv/pv_anrecht-auf-pv-beantragen.html","source_title":"Amt für Sozialversicherungen · Prämienverbilligung beantragen","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"BE:subsidio-borrador","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["f86dc220fc8a51d2a60cec28546124bb"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-be-libero-limites","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"BE","scope":"canton","canton":"BE","topic":"movilidad","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Tienes un billete Libero para unas zonas concretas. ¿Qué compruebas antes de hacer un desvío?","options":["Que el trayecto y la hora estén cubiertos por el título","Solo que sigues dentro de Berna","Solo que el operador sea el mismo","Solo que aún no has hecho la vuelta"],"explanation":"Libero funciona por zonas tarifarias y validez temporal. Vivir en el cantón no amplía el billete.","sources":[{"id":"be-travel-17","url":"https://www.hallo-bern.ch/es/movilidad/tren-y-autobus","title":"Hallo Bern · Tren y autobús","authority":"Kanton Bern, GSI","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Libero"}],"source_url":"https://www.hallo-bern.ch/es/movilidad/tren-y-autobus","source_title":"Hallo Bern · Tren y autobús","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"BE:libero-limites","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["1cea5c20eb722c80f46f7ec71e0ba883"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-be-ruido-viernes","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"BE","scope":"canton","canton":"BE","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Tu edificio en Berna tiene horas de descanso y tu vecino celebra una fiesta el viernes. ¿El viernes anula esas reglas?","options":["No: hay que respetar el reglamento y las normas aplicables","Sí: hasta medianoche no hay reglas","Sí: si has avisado a un solo vecino","Sí: si la fiesta es en casa y no en la calle"],"explanation":"El reglamento de la casa regula también el descanso. Ante una molestia ordinaria, hablar con respeto puede ser el primer paso; si persiste, contacta con la administración.","sources":[