":"TI","scope":"canton","canton":"TI","topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Encuentras peces y reptiles marinos fósiles estudiados en Monte San Giorgio. ¿Qué te cuentan del paisaje de hace millones de años?","options":["Que allí hubo una cuenca marina poco profunda","Que era una gran llanura de agua dulce","Que era un desierto de dunas","Que estaba cubierto por un glaciar permanente"],"explanation":"La investigación paleontológica reconstruye un antiguo medio marino del Triásico, muy distinto al paisaje actual.","sources":[{"id":"ti-fossil-museum-17","url":"https://www.nmz.uzh.ch/en/permanentexhibition/monte_san_giorgio.html","title":"UZH · Monte San Giorgio","authority":"Universität Zürich, Naturhistorisches Museum","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Marine reptiles; fish"}],"source_url":"https://www.nmz.uzh.ch/en/permanentexhibition/monte_san_giorgio.html","source_title":"UZH · Monte San Giorgio","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"TI:rio-prehistorico","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["e464fe90ac236205d22c48f0b82b817c"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ti-barbacoa-humo","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"TI","scope":"canton","canton":"TI","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En Lugano haces una barbacoa en el balcón. ¿Qué recuerda la guía de buen vecindario?","options":["Evitar que humo, olores y ruido molesten a los vecinos","El humo nunca cuenta como molestia","Puedes incumplir el contrato si es fin de semana","Debes dejarla encendida sin vigilancia"],"explanation":"Comprueba el contrato y las reglas del edificio. La guía recomienda prevenir molestias y vigilar el equipo para evitar incendios.","sources":[{"id":"ti-neighbours-17","url":"https://www.lugano.ch/la-mia-citta/la-citta-si-racconta/campagne/buon-vicinato/","title":"Lugano · Con…vivere","authority":"Città di Lugano","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Odori; sicurezza; lavanderia"}],"source_url":"https://www.lugano.ch/la-mia-citta/la-citta-si-racconta/campagne/buon-vicinato/","source_title":"Lugano · Con…vivere","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"TI:barbacoa-humo","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":0},"known":["1d5fd090a0e036758e4b58411257e527"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ti-perro-aleman","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"TI","scope":"canton","canton":"TI","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Vives en Ticino y quieres adquirir un cachorro de pastor alemán. ¿Qué debes saber?","options":["Está entre las razas sujetas a autorización y otras condiciones","La raza está exenta por ser de trabajo","Su tenencia no puede autorizarse nunca","Basta con registrar el microchip, sin otro trámite"],"explanation":"La lista cantonal incluye al pastor alemán y sus cruces. Hay que consultar y cumplir el procedimiento antes de adquirirlo.","sources":[{"id":"ti-dogs-17","url":"https://www4.ti.ch/dss/dsp/uvc/temi/tenuta-di-animali/cani/razze-soggette-a-restrizioni","title":"Ticino · Razze soggette a restrizioni","authority":"Ufficio del veterinario cantonale","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Restrizioni; elenco"}],"source_url":"https://www4.ti.ch/dss/dsp/uvc/temi/tenuta-di-animali/cani/razze-soggette-a-restrizioni","source_title":"Ticino · Razze soggette a restrizioni","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"TI:perro-aleman","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["ad0d66e65e41e975eb36936392e54b60"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ti-perro-quien-decide","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"TI","scope":"canton","canton":"TI","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Solicitas autorización para un perro sujeto a restricciones en Ticino. ¿Quién toma la decisión sobre concederla?","options":["El Ufficio del veterinario cantonale, tras la tramitación municipal","La tienda de alimentación","El administrador de la comunidad por sí solo","La persona que regala el perro"],"explanation":"El municipio recibe y verifica la solicitud; la oficina veterinaria cantonal resuelve.","sources":[{"id":"ti-dog-law-17","url":"https://m3.ti.ch/CAN/RLeggi/public/index.php/raccolta-leggi/legge/num/869","title":"Ticino · Regolamento sui cani","authority":"Repubblica e Cantone Ticino","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Arts. 6,10,12,14–17"}],"source_url":"https://m3.ti.ch/CAN/RLeggi/public/index.php/raccolta-leggi/legge/num/869","source_title":"Ticino · Regolamento sui cani","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"TI:perro-quien-decide","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","correct_index":0},"known":["bdf0aa3a86d3d15e723524c57567c312"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ti-ripam-significado","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"TI","scope":"canton","canton":"TI","topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En Ticino oyes hablar de la RIPAM. ¿Qué ayuda es?","options":["Reducción de las primas del seguro de enfermedad","Una prestación del seguro de desempleo","Una ayuda al pago del al