iga para ver si están sanos"],"explanation":"Pueden ser crías de gato montés cuya madre está cazando. No deduzcas abandono solo porque estén momentáneamente solas.","sources":[{"id":"bl-wildlife-17","url":"https://www.baselland.ch/politik-und-behorden/direktionen/volkswirtschafts-und-gesundheitsdirektion/medienmitteilungen/ab-1-april-wieder-leinenpflicht-zum-schutz-der-wildtiere","title":"Basel-Landschaft · Correa y fauna","authority":"Kanton Basel-Landschaft","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Aviso30.03.2026; Leine; Wildkatzen"}],"source_url":"https://www.baselland.ch/politik-und-behorden/direktionen/volkswirtschafts-und-gesundheitsdirektion/medienmitteilungen/ab-1-april-wieder-leinenpflicht-zum-schutz-der-wildtiere","source_title":"Basel-Landschaft · Correa y fauna","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"BL:gatitos-monteses","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0},"known":["09d13470254f8b30fa77a4660628cb38"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-bl-lavadero-reglas","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"BL","scope":"canton","canton":"BL","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En tu edificio de Basel-Landschaft compartís lavadero. ¿Dónde suelen figurar las reglas de uso?","options":["En la Hausordnung del inmueble","En el mapa de trenes","En cualquier calendario de otro cantón","Solo en el pasaporte"],"explanation":"Consulta el reglamento de tu casa y habla con la administración si hay dudas.","sources":[{"id":"bl-neighbours-17","url":"https://www.hallo-baselland.ch/es/vivir/vecindario","title":"Hallo Baselland · Vecindario","authority":"Portal de información del cantón Basel-Landschaft","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Reglas de casa; conflictos"}],"source_url":"https://www.hallo-baselland.ch/es/vivir/vecindario","source_title":"Hallo Ba