-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"BS:rottweiler-adquirir","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["50536575dd1c337a8384650d398f7074"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-bs-razas-lista","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"BS","scope":"canton","canton":"BS","topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"multi","prompt":"¿Cuáles de estas razas aparecen en la lista de autorización previa de Basel-Stadt?","options":["Rottweiler","Dobermann","Caniche","Bichón maltés"],"explanation":"La lista también contempla otras razas y cruces; consulta el caso concreto antes de adquirir el perro.","sources":[{"id":"bs-dogs-17","url":"https://www.bs.ch/themen/umwelt-und-bauen/tiere-und-pflanzen/hunde/bewilligungspflichtige-hunderassen","title":"Basel-Stadt · Perros sujetos a autorización","authority":"Kantonales Veterinäramt Basel-Stadt","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Razas afectadas; requisitos; procedimientos especiales"}],"source_url":"https://www.bs.ch/themen/umwelt-und-bauen/tiere-und-pflanzen/hunde/bewilligungspflichtige-hunderassen","source_title":"Basel-Stadt · Perros sujetos a autorización","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"BS:razas-lista","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"correct_indices":[0,1],"correct_index":0},"known":["cb2040656dc9c64eed7e6c135b13ccb1"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-bs-basura-vispera","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"BS","scope":"canton","canton":"BS","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En la ciudad de Basel, mañana es la recogida de tu calle. ¿Desde cuándo puedes sacar el Bebbi-Sack la víspera?","options":["Desde las 19:00","Desde las 08:00","Desde las 12:00","Desde las 22:00"],"explanation":"Usa el calendario de tu calle. En jornadas de mucho calor se adelanta el límite de la mañana de recogida.","sources":[{"id":"bs-waste-17","url":"https://www.bs.ch/themen/umwelt-und-bauen/abfall-und-sauberkeit/abfall-abc/hauskehricht","title":"Ciudad de Basel · Residuos domésticos","authority":"Kanton Basel-Stadt, Stadtreinigung","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Was und was nicht; Wo/Wann; Riehen und Bettingen"}],"source_url":"https://www.bs.ch/themen/umwelt-und-bauen/abfall-und-sauberkeit/abfall-abc/hauskehricht","source_title":"Ciudad de Basel · Residuos domésticos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"BS:basura-vispera","status":"published","municipality":"Basel","jurisdiction_note":"Regla municipal de la ciudad de Basel; Riehen y Bettingen tienen sus propias instrucciones.","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["829cf21da47426c45d7fd05ca9898b81"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-bs-subsidio-mes-bs","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"BS","scope":"canton","canton":"BS","topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Vives en Basel-Stadt desde antes del 1 de enero. Pides la reducción de primas ordinaria el 20 de febrero y te la conceden. ¿Desde qué mes vale?","options":["Marzo","Febrero","Enero del mismo año","Abril"],"explanation":"La página cantonal fija el inicio en el mes siguiente al de la solicitud. No es la misma regla que la de todos los demás cantones.","sources":[{"id":"bs-subsidy-17","url":"https://www.bs.ch/themen/finanzielle-hilfe/leistungen/praemienverbilligung/praemienverbilligung-beantragen","title":"Basel-Stadt · Solicitar Prämienverbilligung","authority":"Amt für Sozialbeiträge Basel-Stadt","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Ihre Anmeldung; Unterlagen; Zusage"}],"source_url":"https://www.bs.ch/themen/finanzielle-hilfe/leistungen/praemienverbilligung/praemienverbilligung-beantragen","source_title":"Basel-Stadt · Solicitar Prämienverbilligung","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"BS:subsidio-mes-bs","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["842c0335304be912d488a2e7c403d58d"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-bs-subsidio-oficina-bs","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"BS","scope":"canton","canton":"BS","topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Tu domicilio el 1 de enero estaba en Basel-Stadt. ¿Qué oficina cantonal tramita la Prämienverbilligung?","options":["Amt für Sozialbeiträge","La oficina de turismo","El registro de perros","La empresa del tranvía"],"explanation":"El domicilio al comienzo del año determina normalmente el cantón competente.","sources":[{"id":"bs-subsidy-17","url":"https://www.bs.ch/themen/finanzielle-hilfe/leistungen/praemienverbilligung/praemienverbilligung-beantragen","title":"Basel-Stadt · Solicitar Prämienverbilligung","authority":"Amt für Sozialbeiträge Basel-Stadt","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Ihre Anmeldung; Unterlagen; Zusage"}],"source_url":"https://www.bs.ch/themen/finanzielle-hilfe/leistungen/praemienverbilligung/praemienverbilligung-beantragen","source_title":"Basel-Stadt · Solicitar Prämienverbilligung","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id