ua es tu lengua materna, en los supuestos indicados","Enseñar tu puntuación de Suizamente"],"explanation":"La oficina comprueba el caso y los documentos. El juego no certifica idioma ni concede permisos.","sources":[{"id":"fr-permit-17","url":"https://www.fr.ch/vie-quotidienne/demarches-et-documents/permis-c","title":"Fribourg · Permiso C","authority":"Service de la population et des migrants","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Documentos para acreditar idioma"}],"source_url":"https://www.fr.ch/vie-quotidienne/demarches-et-documents/permis-c","source_title":"Fribourg · Permiso C","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"FR:acreditar-idioma-c","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","game_only":true,"correct_indices":[0,1,2],"correct_index":0},"known":["f4d1963393a85aededc6c52a73c283f4"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-fr-vitro-romont","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"FR","scope":"canton","canton":"FR","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En Romont, ¿a qué arte se dedica especialmente el Vitromusée?","options":["Vidrieras y otras artes del vidrio","Pintura al óleo","Relojería","Bordado"],"explanation":"Sus colecciones incluyen vidrieras, pintura bajo vidrio y creación artística en vidrio.","sources":[{"id":"fr-vitro-17","url":"https://vitromusee.ch/collections/","title":"Vitromusée Romont · Colecciones","authority":"Fondation du Vitromusée Romont","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Vidriera, pintura bajo vidrio y vidrio artístico"}],"source_url":"https://vitromusee.ch/collections/","source_title":"Vitromusée Romont · Colecciones","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"FR:vitro-romont","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil"