ialhilfe"}],"source_url":"https://www.sg.ch/gesundheit-soziales/gesundheit/krankenversicherung0/praemienverbilligung.html","source_title":"St. Gallen · Reducción de primas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:prima-plazo","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":2,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["95a36b8a2bd033b0a361393639781b27"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-prima-tarde","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Pides reducción de primas en St. Gallen en mayo, pasado marzo. Si cumples los requisitos y no te restituyen excepcionalmente el plazo, ¿desde qué mes se reconoce?","options":["Siempre desde enero del mismo año","Desde junio, el mes siguiente","Solo desde enero del año siguiente","Desde mayo, el mes de presentación"],"explanation":"No equivale a perder necesariamente toda la ayuda del año: importa el mes de solicitud.","sources":[{"id":"sg-ipv-17","url":"https://www.sg.ch/gesundheit-soziales/gesundheit/krankenversicherung0/praemienverbilligung.html","title":"St. Gallen · Reducción de primas","authority":"Amt für Gesundheitsversorgung, Kanton St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Antragsfrist; EL; Sozialhilfe"}],"source_url":"https://www.sg.ch/gesundheit-soziales/gesundheit/krankenversicherung0/praemienverbilligung.html","source_title":"St. Gallen · Reducción de primas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:prima-tarde","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","correct_index":3,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","k