identes de la persona titular"],"explanation":"Es una obligación distinta del registro y del impuesto canino.","sources":[{"id":"sg-dogs-17","url":"https://www.gesetzessammlung.sg.ch/frontend/versions/2873/download_pdf_file?locale=de","title":"St. Gallen · Ley de perros","authority":"Gesetzessammlung Kanton St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"sGS456.1, arts.6–14"}],"source_url":"https://www.gesetzessammlung.sg.ch/frontend/versions/2873/download_pdf_file?locale=de","source_title":"St. Gallen · Ley de perros","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:perro-seguro","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["bbdf94827a441669cfb99da050874914"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-viernes-ruido","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Viernes a las 22:30, música fuerte en una vivienda de la ciudad de St. Gallen. ¿Qué indica la policía municipal sobre esa hora?","options":["Que el viernes se permite ruido hasta medianoche","Que el descanso empieza a las 23:00","Que ya está dentro de la franja nocturna de 22:00 a 07:00","Que el horario lo decide cada vecino"],"explanation":"Puedes pedir consideración y, si persiste la perturbación, contactar con la policía municipal. No se está calificando cualquier sonido normal como infracción.","sources":[{"id":"sg-noise-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/gesellschaft-sicherheit/sicherheit-polizei/praevention/laerm-schallmessungen.html","title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Ruido y descanso","authority":"Stadtpolizei St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Ruhezeiten/Nachtzeiten"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/gesellschaft-sicherheit/sicherheit-polizei/praevention/laerm-schallmessungen.html","source_title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Ruido y descanso","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:viernes-ruido","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":2,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["ecae8b347440b1653c57a2d0f19e232f"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-vidrio-domingo","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Domingo por la tarde, tienes botellas para el punto de recogida de la ciudad de St. Gallen. ¿Qué corresponde?","options":["Tirarlas rápido para que apenas se oiga","Dejarlas fuera del contenedor","Usarlo si no ves a nadie","Esperar un horario permitido: los puntos no se usan domingos ni festivos"],"explanation":"El horario también protege el descanso de las personas que viven cerca.","sources":[{"id":"sg-waste-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","authority":"Entsorgung St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Abwasser, Aludosen, Einwurfszeiten, Altglas, Kehricht"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","source_title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:vidrio-domingo","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":3},"known":["fc24edfb0b9247e99cd600603d146abd"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-residuos-vasos","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"multi","prompt":"¿Qué objetos NO van con las botellas al contenedor de vidrio de la ciudad de St. Gallen?","options":["Vasos de beber","Cristales de ventana","Botellas de vidrio vacías aptas para esa recogida","Frascos de conserva de vidrio aptos para esa recogida"],"explanation":"Los diferentes tipos de vidrio no se reciclan todos por la misma vía. Consulta la vía local para vasos y cristales.","sources":[{"id":"sg-waste-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","authority":"Entsorgung St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Abwasser, Aludosen, Einwurfszeiten, Altglas, Kehricht"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","source_title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:residuos-vasos","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","game_only":true,"correct_indices":[0,1],"correct_index":0},"known":["b2a1bae1c9f0e4fb921dd49acd3db078"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-wc-residuos","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Después de limpiar el baño en St. Gallen, ¿dónde deben ir los bastoncillos y las compresas usados?","options":["Al inodoro","A los residuos domésticos, según las indicaciones locales","Al contenedor de botellas","A una alcantarilla de la calle"],"explanation":"La red de saneamiento no es una papelera. La ciudad los incluye entre lo que no debe tirarse al váter.","sources":[{"id":"sg-waste-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","authority":"Entsorgung St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Abwasser, Aludosen, Einwurfszeiten, Altglas, Kehricht"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/raum-umwelt/abfall-entsorgung/Abfallarten.html","source_title":"Ciudad de St. Gallen · Separación de residuos","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:wc-residuos","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":1},"known":["10ebdd18af1a947c9c7cd1e3fdee6091"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-prima-oficina","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"¿Qué entidad gestiona la reducción de primas en el cantón de St. Gallen?","options":["La oficina de turismo","El vendedor de un seguro de viaje","La Sozialversicherungsanstalt, SVA St.Gallen","La biblioteca de la abadía"],"explanation":"La oficina AHV de tu municipio también orienta si no puedes completar la solicitud por internet.","sources":[{"id":"sg-ipv-17","url":"https://www.sg.ch/gesundheit-soziales/gesundheit/krankenversicherung0/praemienverbilligung.html","title":"St. Gallen · Reducción de primas","authority":"Amt für Gesundheitsversorgung, Kanton St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Antragsfrist; EL; Sozialhilfe"}],"source_url":"https://www.sg.ch/gesundheit-soziales/gesundheit/krankenversicherung0/praemienverbilligung.html","source_title":"St. Gallen · Reducción de primas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SG:prima-oficina","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":2},"known":["7edd35c590bb076d51878f4efa163e56"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-curso-nivel","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"idioma","category":"idioma","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Quieres empezar alemán en St. Gallen, pero aún sabes muy poco. ¿Qué muestra la información de la ciudad?","options":["Que solo admite a personas bilingües","Que todos los cursos tienen el mismo nivel","Que solo hay clases para turistas","Que hay cursos de distintos niveles e intensidad"],"explanation":"Conviene escoger una oferta adecuada a tu punto de partida y consultar sus condiciones.","sources":[{"id":"sg-language-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/gesellschaft-sicherheit/leben-schweiz/sprache.html","title":"St. Gallen · Aprender alemán y biblioteca intercultural","authority":"Stadt St.Gallen, Gesellschaftsfragen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Cursos; LibraForum; ofertas para familias"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/gesellschaft-sicherheit/leben-schweiz/sprache.html","source_title":"St. Gallen · Aprender alemán y biblioteca intercultural","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"SG:curso-nivel","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":3},"known":["f76c19eed04c936f86fbe42a310dc94d"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-aviso-entendido","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"idioma","category":"idioma","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En una ventanilla lees «Bitte warten». ¿Qué traducción corresponde?","options":["Por favor, espere","Por favor, entre","Por favor, vuelva mañana","Por favor, firme aquí"],"explanation":"Es un ejercicio original de alemán estándar para una situación cotidiana.","sources":[{"id":"sg-language-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/gesellschaft-sicherheit/leben-schweiz/sprache.html","title":"St. Gallen · Aprender alemán y biblioteca intercultural","authority":"Stadt St.Gallen, Gesellschaftsfragen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Cursos; LibraForum; ofertas para familias"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/gesellschaft-sicherheit/leben-schweiz/sprache.html","source_title":"St. Gallen · Aprender alemán y biblioteca intercultural","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"SG:aviso-entendido","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","game_only":true,"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["e6f3de841789fbca59c8003ec6843684"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-vadiana","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"La biblioteca cantonal Vadiana recuerda con su nombre a…","options":["Un impresor especializado en mapas de trenes","Vadian, erudito y reformador que legó sus libros a la ciudad","Un compositor del carnaval local","Un antiguo fabricante de bordados"],"explanation":"Su legado de 1551 está en el origen de la antigua biblioteca urbana.","sources":[{"id":"sg-history-17","url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/freizeit-tourismus/stgallen-entdecken/geschichte.html","title":"St. Gallen · Historia urbana y textil","authority":"Stadt St.Gallen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Meilensteine; Textilstadt; Buchstadt"}],"source_url":"https://www.stadt.sg.ch/home/freizeit-tourismus/stgallen-entdecken/geschichte.html","source_title":"St. Gallen · Historia urbana y textil","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"SG:vadiana","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"dificil","correct_index":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["03aa27d9a81765238dad9d8af69a8cb5"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-mostaza-costumbre","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"tf","prompt":"Servir la Bratwurst sin mostaza es una costumbre gastronómica de St. Gallen.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"Es una preferencia cultural: no la presentamos como una ley que multa por usar mostaza.","sources":[{"id":"sg-food-17","url":"https://st.gallen-bodensee.ch/de/blog/story/bratwurst-burli-bier-biber-3026176c-15c6-496e-9248-eaf79023d76f.html","title":"St. Gallen · Bratwurst, Bürli y Biber","authority":"St.Gallen-Bodensee Tourismus","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Apartados1,2,4"}],"source_url":"https://st.gallen-bodensee.ch/de/blog/story/bratwurst-burli-bier-biber-3026176c-15c6-496e-9248-eaf79023d76f.html","source_title":"St. Gallen · Bratwurst, Bürli y Biber","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"SG:mostaza-costumbre","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","game_only":true,"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["244645b5e49fd3e1b52a3d851a05af0c"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sg-pasarela-medieval","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SG","scope":"canton","canton":"SG","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"tf","prompt":"La pasarela actual Rapperswil–Hurden conserva la estructura medieval original sin reconstruir.","options":["Verdadero","Falso"],"explanation":"La conexión tiene antecedentes medievales, pero la pasarela actual se inaugur