ira","Memoria y llamada a la paz","Sendero con estaciones de humor"],"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["1e0f18cdc63b1b656ded7fa9ee043b55"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ar-orden-ruta-witz","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"AR","scope":"canton","canton":"AR","topic":"movilidad","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"order","prompt":"Recorres el Witzweg desde Heiden hacia Walzenhausen. Ordena las localidades.","options":["Walzenhausen","Heiden","Wolfhalden"],"explanation":"La consigna fija el sentido: también es posible caminar en sentido inverso. No son instrucciones de navegación en tiempo real.","sources":[{"id":"ar-witz-17","url":"https://appenzellerland.ch/de/erleben/wandern-bewegen/sommer/wanderrouten/witzweg.html","title":"Ausserrhoden · Witzweg","authority":"Appenzellerland Tourismus AR","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Descripción y Strecke"}],"source_url":"https://appenzellerland.ch/de/erleben/wandern-bewegen/sommer/wanderrouten/witzweg.html","source_title":"Ausserrhoden · Witzweg","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"AR:orden-ruta-witz","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","game_only":true,"correct_order":[1,2,0],"correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["b2c637c14111cb9d83f3a5302f0b98a9"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ar-orden-bloch","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"AR","scope":"canton","canton":"AR","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"order","prompt":"Ordena la secuencia tradicional del Bloch, desde su relato de origen hasta el final.","options":["Se subasta el tronco al final","Se recibe el árbol, según el relato de origen","Se ll