on","canton":"UR","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"image","prompt":"¿Qué objeto del relato de Guillermo Tell reconoces?","options":["Un arco largo","Una ballesta","Una honda","Una catapulta"],"explanation":"Es una ilustración genérica; no se reproduce una escultura u obra artística.","sources":[{"id":"ur-tell-17","url":"https://uri.swiss/uri-1291/mythos-tell","title":"Uri · El mito de Tell","authority":"Uri Tourismus","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Dem Mythos Tell näher kommen"}],"source_url":"https://uri.swiss/uri-1291/mythos-tell","source_title":"Uri · El mito de Tell","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"UR:imagen-ballesta","status":"published","image_rights":"Ilustración SVG original de Latido; sin fotografías, marcas comerciales ni recursos externos.","image_key":"ur-crossbow","image_alt":"Ballesta esquemática de madera con arco transversal y cuerda","editorial_difficulty":"facil","game_only":true,"correct_index":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["3466e7bdfc03e484ce04b9e09c4610f8","87cd3f808ed5ab23d23198b7dde9e1fa"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ur-imagen-puente","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"UR","scope":"canton","canton":"UR","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"image","prompt":"¿Qué puente de leyenda de Uri reconoces?","options":["Kapellbrücke","Ponte dei Salti","Teufelsbrücke","Pont de Berne"],"explanation":"El contexto fija Uri y su leyenda. El dibujo es un esquema, no una vista topográfica exacta.","sources":[{"id":"ur-facts-17","url":"https://www.ur.ch/_docn/410917/Zahlen_und_Fakten_Uri.pdf","title":"Uri · Patrimonio, dialecto y pasos alpinos","authority":"Uri Tourismus, folleto alojado por el cantón","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator