ica la caja?","options":["Renunciar: solo existe la vía digital","Contactarla para recibir un formulario en papel","Enviar un correo sin formulario a cualquier oficina","Usar las claves de otra persona"],"explanation":"La FAQ ofrece el formulario por correo a quien no puede utilizar la vía online.","sources":[{"id":"ow-ipv-17","url":"https://www.akow.ch/dienstleistungen/praemienverbilligung","title":"Obwalden · Reducción de primas","authority":"Ausgleichskasse Obwalden","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Anspruch, Anmeldung y FAQ, campaña 2027"}],"source_url":"https://www.akow.ch/dienstleistungen/praemienverbilligung","source_title":"Obwalden · Reducción de primas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2026-12-31","concept_id":"OW:ipv-papel-2027","status":"published","validity_year":2027,"editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["a0cb871d188db9455b60dede32f6df13"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ow-ipv-invitacion-2027","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"OW","scope":"canton","canton":"OW","topic":"tramites","category":"salud","difficulty":5,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En la campaña 2027 de Obwalden recibes una invitación con claves personales. No cobras EL ni ayuda social económica. ¿Qué paso sigue?","options":["Esperar: recibir claves ya es presentar la solicitud","Pedir a tu empleador que la tramite automáticamente","Presentar tu solicitud; la invitación no la sustituye","Comprar un seguro complementario antes de responder"],"explanation":"La caja identifica posibles beneficiarios e invita a solicitar; después calcula y comunica la decisión.","sources":[{"id":"ow-ipv-17","url":"https://www.akow.ch/dienstleistungen/praemienverbilligung","title":"Obwalden · Reducción de primas","authority":"Ausgleichskasse Obwalden","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Anspruch, Anmeldung y FAQ, campaña 2027"}],"source_url":"https://www.akow.ch/dienstleistungen/praemienverbilligung","source_title":"Obwalden · Reducción de primas","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2026-12-31","concept_id":"OW:ipv-invitacion-2027","status":"published","validity_year":2027,"editorial_difficulty":"dificil","correct_index":2,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["fd513f694cffd20ab4d8ef3e9373c28a"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ow-vivienda-documentos","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"OW","scope":"canton","canton":"OW","topic":"convivencia","category":"vivienda","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Solicitas una vivienda en Obwalden. ¿Cómo averiguas qué justificantes debes adjuntar?","options":["Todos los propietarios piden exactamente lo mismo","Solo presentando una fotografía","Nunca se adjunta ningún documento","Revisando el formulario y los requisitos de esa candidatura"],"explanation":"El portal enumera documentos posibles; no los convierte todos en obligatorios para cada caso.","sources":[{"id":"ow-housing-17","url":"https://integration.ow.ch/wohnen/","title":"Obwalden · Buscar vivienda y mudarse","authority":"Fachstelle Gesellschaftsfragen Obwalden","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Preguntas 2–6"}],"source_url":"https://integration.ow.ch/wohnen/","source_title":"Obwalden · Buscar vivienda y mudarse","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"OW:vivienda-documentos","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":3},"known":["d4bf53ad3862f5bba82f6624cecda250"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-ow-traslado-tercer-pais","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"OW","sc