3feb65204ab8f9ac"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-nw-perro-parque","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"NW","scope":"canton","canton":"NW","topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Quieres entrar en un parque infantil de Nidwalden con tu perro de compañía. Según el art. 7 de la ley de perros, ¿basta con ponerle correa?","options":["Sí, siempre","Sí, si es pequeño","Solo importa la hora","No: llevar perros al parque infantil está prohibido"],"explanation":"La ley distingue prohibición de acceso de obligación de correa. El supuesto no trata de perros de asistencia.","sources":[{"id":"nw-dogs-17","url":"https://gesetze.nw.ch/api/de/versions/696/pdf_file","title":"Nidwalden · Ley de perros","authority":"Gesetzessammlung Nidwalden, NG 826.3","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Artículos 3–8, páginas 2–3; consolidado enlazado desde Amt für Justiz"}],"source_url":"https://gesetze.nw.ch/api/de/versions/696/pdf_file","source_title":"Nidwalden · Ley de perros","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"NW:perro-parque","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":3},"known":["94acd80acdda6f28f1c249dcfce8db82"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-nw-perro-deporte","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"NW","scope":"canton","canton":"NW","topic":"derechos","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"En una instalación deportiva de Nidwalden, ¿qué exige el art. 7 al llevar un perro?","options":["Correa","Puede ir suelto si no hay nadie","Basta con llevar su cartilla","Solo se exige controlarlo al anochecer"],"explanation":"La regla también menciona recintos escolares. Pueden existir otras limitaciones específicas.","sources":[{"id":"nw-dogs-17","url":"https://gesetze.nw.ch/api/de/versions/696/pdf_file","title":"Nidwalden · Ley de perros","authority":"Gesetzessammlung Nidwalden, NG 826.3","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Artículos 3–8, páginas 2–3; consolidado enlazado desde Amt für Justiz"}],"source_url":"https://gesetze.nw.ch/api/de/versions/696/pdf_file","source_title":"Nidwalden · Ley de perros","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"NW:perro-deporte","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":0,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["90e7ab8defdb06c18ef884f5e09a7826"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-nw-amicus-aceptar","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"NW","scope":"canton","canton":"NW","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Recibes un perro de otra persona en Nidwalden. ¿Qué paso necesita la transferencia en AMICUS para quedar completada?","options":["Cambiarle el nombre","Que la nueva persona titular acepte la transmisión en AMICUS","Registrar una dirección de correo nueva","Comunicarlo solo a la aseguradora"],"explanation":"Hasta esa aceptación no se considera completado el cambio respecto de la persona anterior.","sources":[{"id":"nw-dog-register-17","url":"https://www.nw.ch/amtjustizdienste/581","title":"Nidwalden · Registro de perros","authority":"Amt für Justiz Nidwalden","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Halterwechsel y Allgemeine Mutationen"}],"source_url":"https://www.nw.ch/amtjustizdienste/581","source_title":"Nidwalden · Registro de perros","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"NW:amicus-aceptar","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":1,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind"