":"ZG","scope":"canton","canton":"ZG","topic":"cultura","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"Además de marcar la hora, ¿qué función histórica tuvo el Zytturm de Zug?","options":["Depósito de agua","Campanario de catedral","Puerta de la ciudad y torre de vigilancia","Torre de una fábrica textil"],"explanation":"La torre también albergó pequeñas celdas conocidas como Timpis.","sources":[{"id":"zg-tower-17","url":"https://www.zug-tourismus.ch/de/zytturm/","title":"Zug · Zytturm","authority":"Zug Tourismus","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Historia, reloj astronómico y Besuch"}],"source_url":"https://www.zug-tourismus.ch/de/zytturm/","source_title":"Zug · Zytturm","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"ZG:torre-antigua-funcion","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"media","correct_index":2,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["7e04bd3e1aa4b74a85ceb3bf24a1dc41"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-zg-cueva-agua","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"ZG","scope":"canton","canton":"ZG","topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":3,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"¿Qué fue esencial para formar la toba y los depósitos de las Höllgrotten?","options":["Una acumulación de lava","La excavación de un río salado","La compactación de nieve","Agua con cal disuelta"],"explanation":"El agua depositó material calcáreo; el proceso no requiere un origen volcánico.","sources":[{"id":"zg-caves-17","url":"https://www.hoellgrotten.ch/de/hoehlen.html","title":"Zug · Höllgrotten","authority":"Fundación Höllgrotten, gestor de las cuevas","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Junge Höhlen, Vorhang zu y Steter Tropfen formt den Stein"}],"source_url":"https://www.hoellgrotten.ch/de/hoehlen.html","source_title":"Zug · H