rn. ¿Qué lugar encaja?","options":["Ruinaulta","Gorges de l’Areuse","Verenaschlucht","Lötschental"],"explanation":"La garganta de Verena conduce hacia la ermita. Comprueba condiciones y avisos antes de salir.","sources":[{"id":"so-verena-17","url":"https://www.solothurn-city.ch/attraktionen/verenaschlucht-und-die-einsiedelei-6ad6c9a49d","title":"Solothurn · Garganta de Verena","authority":"Solothurn Tourismus","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Verenaschlucht und die Einsiedelei, Gut zu wissen"}],"source_url":"https://www.solothurn-city.ch/attraktionen/verenaschlucht-und-die-einsiedelei-6ad6c9a49d","source_title":"Solothurn · Garganta de Verena","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":false,"next_review_at":"2027-11-17","concept_id":"SO:verena-paseo","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":2,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["55afa8defbcc829741227502131ede0b"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-so-altreu-observar","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SO","scope":"canton","canton":"SO","topic":"naturaleza","category":"sociedad","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"¿Qué aves anidan sobre los tejados de Altreu?","options":["Garzas reales","Cisnes","Grullas","Cigüeñas blancas"],"explanation":"Altreu está ligado a la recuperación de la cigüeña blanca en Suiza; hoy las aves asentadas buscan su alimento.","sources":[{"id":"so-storks-17","url":"https://www.selzach.ch/tourismus/storchensiedlung-altreu/storchensiedlung-altreu.html/144","title":"Solothurn · Cigüeñas de Altreu","authority":"Gemeinde Selzach","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Infozentrum Witi Altreu, texto principal"}],"source_url":"https://www.selzach.ch/tourismus/storchensiedlung-altreu/storchensiedlung-altreu.html/144","source_title":"Solothurn · Cigüeñas de Altreu","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verifi