ión o frecuencia fija.","sources":[{"id":"sh-faq-17","url":"https://schaffhauserland.ch/faq.html","title":"Schaffhausen · Descubrir la región","authority":"Schaffhauserland Tourismus","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Preguntas de transporte, Erker, Randen y Stein am Rhein"}],"source_url":"https://schaffhauserland.ch/faq.html","source_title":"Schaffhausen · Descubrir la región","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SH:parada-cataratas-sh","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil","correct_index":3,"editorial_review":{"date":"2026-11-18","revision":"complete-14","kind":"wording-and-interaction"}},"known":["b2b40d22cfc2aab02e93aa7d5f29dabf"]},{"question":{"id":"szx-sh-integres-espanol-sh","collection":"suizamente-integration-1350-v1","territory":"SH","scope":"canton","canton":"SH","topic":"tramites","category":"administracion","difficulty":1,"language":"es","game_type":"choice","prompt":"No entiendes una carta y buscas orientación en español en Schaffhausen. ¿Qué servicio publica esa posibilidad?","options":["Integres","La torre Hohenklingen","El embarcadero del Rheinfall","El aparcamiento de un supermercado"],"explanation":"Integres indica alemán, inglés y español, además de posible interpretación. La ayuda de orientación es gratuita.","sources":[{"id":"sh-integres-17","url":"https://integres.ch/beratung","title":"Schaffhausen · Orientación Integres","authority":"Integres, Integrationsfachstelle Region Schaffhausen","checked_at":"2026-11-17","locator":"Beratungsbereiche, Beratungssprachen, Konflikte y Kosten"}],"source_url":"https://integres.ch/beratung","source_title":"Schaffhausen · Orientación Integres","reviewed_at":"2026-11-17","verified_at":"2026-11-17","validation_status":"verified","needs_periodic_review":true,"next_review_at":"2027-02-17","concept_id":"SH:integres-espanol-sh","status":"published","editorial_difficulty":"facil",